<section class="rvst">
  <h2 class="rvst-h2">How The Wear May Show Up Over Time</h2>
  <div class="rvst-grid">
    <div class="rvst-card">
      <div class="rvst-img"><img src="__IMG_STAGE1__" alt="It starts small" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="rvst-txt"><p class="rvst-stage">Stage 1</p><h3>It Starts Small</h3><p>You feel a little off. Energy isn't quite there. Some afternoons you crash. A few cravings creep in. Easy to brush aside.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="rvst-card">
      <div class="rvst-img"><img src="__IMG_STAGE2__" alt="It adds up" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="rvst-txt"><p class="rvst-stage">Stage 2</p><h3>It Adds Up</h3><p>The crashes come most days now. Cravings win more often. The foam in the bowl is harder to ignore — even when you've eaten "clean."</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="rvst-card">
      <div class="rvst-img"><img src="__IMG_STAGE3__" alt="It hits hard" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="rvst-txt"><p class="rvst-stage">Stage 3</p><h3>It Hits Hard</h3><p>You're tired all the time. The numbers at the doctor go the wrong way — even when you did everything they asked. You feel old.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
